### What Was Deliberately Removed

| Removed | Reason |
|---|---|
| `ObservableObject` on all models | ViewModel layer owns change notification |
| Nullable FK columns on `Note` | Replaced by `OwnerId + OwnerType` |
| `Character`, `Theme`, `CodexEntry`, `StoryThread` as separate classes | Collapsed into `StoryEntity` |
| `PlotPointCharacter`, `PlotPointTheme`, `PlotPointCodexEntry`, `PlotPointStoryThread` | Replaced by `PlotPointLink` TPH hierarchy |
| `Synopsis`, `Stakes`, `Outcome`, `ReaderState`, `VerbatimText` on `PlotPoint` | Become `Note` rows with appropriate `NoteTrack` |
| `DevelopmentNote`, `Commentary`, `ImpactDescription` on junction classes | Become `Note` rows owned by the junction's surrogate Id |
| Navigation collections on models (`ObservableCollection<Note>`, etc.) | Owned by ViewModels, not models |
